# =============================================================================
# .gitignore  --  findex-oic-religious-exclusion
#
# This folder holds ONLY publishable material. That is the primary protection:
# what is not here cannot be published. This file is the second line of
# defence -- it catches non-distributable material copied in by accident,
# at any depth, at any time.
# =============================================================================

# ---- Findex microdata and individual-level derivatives ----------------------
# Forbidden by the Findex terms of use. Never distributable, in any form.
raw/
clean/
*.zip
*.rds
*.RData
*.sav
*.dta

# ---- local working material -------------------------------------------------
# Legal to publish, but no reason to: working notes, superseded drafts, and
# the research agenda, which names papers not yet written.
docs/working/
docs/superseded/
docs/diagnostics/

# ---- third-party documents ---------------------------------------------------
# World Bank questionnaires, IFSB reports, central bank PDFs. Not ours to
# republish. Cited by URL and checksum instead.
docs/questionnaires/
*.pdf

# ---- R environment -----------------------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj
.Renviron

# ---- Windows and editors -----------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
~$*

# ---- belt and braces: wherever these end up ---------------------------------
**/panel_individual*
**/*DO_NOT_DISTRIBUTE*
**/*_PARTIAL*
